'''Historical package.''' SF Auto Stamina Refill is not in the current repository package list. Its package ID was <code>sf-auto-stamina-refill</code>.

The mod repeatedly refilled stamina to the maximum. It targeted the client and Dedicated Server, requested the runtime capability, and declared one player setting.

{| class="wikitable"
! Setting !! Key !! Default !! Effect
|-
| Auto Refill || <code>autoRefill</code> || <code>true</code> || Turns repeated stamina refill to the maximum on or off.
|}

This historical behavior is different from [[Mod: Survival|SF Survival's Infinite Stamina setting]]. Survival uses the original attribute bounds and does not repeatedly refill the current stamina value.

